        <p class="pe-solution-text" style="font-weight: 800; color: #ea580c; font-size: 1rem; margin-bottom: 12px; line-height: 1.4;">
          &#128161; STOP GUESSING. START DESIGNING.
        </p>
        <p class="pe-solution-text" style="font-weight: 800; font-size: 0.95rem; color: #111827; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 24px;">
          &#128218; GET THE COMPLETE 6-BOOK COLLECTION TODAY!
